* A1_conventional_cascode_mirror, testbench A_ac
* LTspice netlist (PTM 90 nm). Open in LTspice (File > Open, all files) and Run.
* AC at Iin = 10 uA: input impedance = V(inn) for the 1 A AC source; current gain = I(Vo).
.include ptm90.lib
Vdd vdd 0 1
Vcn vcn 0 0.42
Vo out 0 0.5
M1C y vcn x 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
M1 x y 0 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
M2C out vcn x2 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
M2 x2 y 0 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
Vjoin inn y 0
Iin 0 inn 10u AC 1
.ac dec 40 1k 10G
.meas AC rin_1k FIND mag(V(inn)) AT=1k
.meas AC bw_3dB WHEN mag(I(Vo))=0.7071 FALL=1
.backanno
.end
